 "response": {
  "text": "If your main concern is **active acne, blackheads, clogged pores, or oily skin**, I’d buy a **2% salicylic-acid serum** rather than a generic “glow” serum. Current Indian listings put several good options well below ₹700. [www.nykaa.com](https://www.nykaa.com/dp/serum-for-open-pores?utm_source=chatgpt.com)[www.1mg.com](https://www.1mg.com/otc/the-derma-co-2-sali-cinamide-anti-acne-serum-otc932964?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n### My picks under ₹700\n\n### [The Derma Co Sali-Cinamide Anti-Acne Face Serum]()\n*₹314*\n\n### [Foxtale 12% Niacinamide Face Serum with Azelaic Acid]()\n*₹187*\n\n### [Dot & Key Cica + 2% Salicylic Skin Clearing Serum]()\n*₹339*\n\n### [The Derma Co. 2% Salicylic Acid Face Serum]()\n*₹237*\n\n### [Deconstruct Anti-Acne Clearing Serum]()\n*₹449*\n\n**🥇 Best overall for active acne:** **The Derma Co Sali-Cinamide** — 2% salicylic acid + 5% niacinamide, targeting both breakouts and excess oil. Current listings are around ₹314–₹545 depending on seller. [www.nykaa.com](https://www.nykaa.com/dp/serum-for-open-pores?utm_source=chatgpt.com)[www.1mg.com](https://www.1mg.com/otc/the-derma-co-2-sali-cinamide-anti-acne-serum-otc932964?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n**🥈 Best if you mainly have acne marks + occasional acne:** **Foxtale 12% Niacinamide + Azelaic Acid**. It is more focused on oil control, redness and post-acne marks than unclogging pores. [www.ndtvshopping.com](https://www.ndtvshopping.com/beauty-and-grooming/foxtale-serums-tested-and-reviewed-10981152?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n**🥉 Best gentler-feeling option:** **Dot & Key Cica + 2% Salicylic**, particularly if you want salicylic acid alongside a soothing ingredient.\n\n**How I'd use it:** start **2–3 nights a week**, 2–3 drops on clean, dry skin, followed by moisturizer. If your skin tolerates it, gradually increase. Use **SPF 30–50 every morning**. Don't start several exfoliating/active products simultaneously.\n\nIf you tell me **(1) oily/dry/combination skin, (2) active pimples vs blackheads vs acne marks, and (3) whether your skin is sensitive**, I can narrow it down to **one serum** for you.",
